{"id":"wb-6-1050","name":"“二十四道拐”抗战公路","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"“二十四道拐”抗战公路","text":"“二十四道拐”抗战公路位于今中华人民共和国贵州省晴隆县城西南1公里，最早由贵州省路政局修建并于1936年9月通车。1943年，援华美军司令部1880工兵营对该路进行改造变为“二十一道拐”，是史迪威公路或称旧中印公路的其中一段。旧320国道（滇黔公路）的一部分。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E2%80%9C%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E9%81%93%E6%8B%90%E2%80%9D%E6%8A%97%E6%88%98%E5%85%AC%E8%B7%AF","revisionId":94784132,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94784132","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/019360bd7cc65fbee4d8bcc3.jpg","title":"Ledo & Burma Roads. Assam, Burma, China. 1944-45 - NARA - 292561.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ledo_%26_Burma_Roads._Assam,_Burma,_China._1944-45_-_NARA_-_292561.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/Ledo_%26_Burma_Roads._Assam%2C_Burma%2C_China._1944-45_-_NARA_-_292561.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"未知Unknown author​或​未提供","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"Scope and content:  Individual Burma Roads.","width":320,"height":397,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata 条目的 P18 配图"}}